      "description": "Lean replaces the concrete assumption that S includes EA with inclusion of provable sentences between abstract classical systems. It assumes selected epistemic properties explicitly: necessitation for the base, and distribution and known factivity in S. It does not require the base to have the full axioms or language of EA."
